%% description: One working session, step by step. Scores judge how well today's Archer supports each step.
journey
    title A Working Session With Archer
    section Set Up
        archer setup installs the CLI and skill: 4: Person
        archer init writes archer.toml and .archer: 5: Agent
    section Explain
        Write a diagram or a note with fences: 5: Agent
        Validate and fix from diagnostics: 5: Agent
        Present it and give the link: 4: Agent, Person
        Light the path with emphasis: 4: Agent, Person
    section Discuss
        Select parts and ask about them: 4: Person, Agent
        Comment, then send to the agent: 4: Person
        Agent revises, replies and resolves: 5: Agent
    section Keep It True
        Live redraw names the change: 5: Person
        Staleness from covers and Git: 3: Person, Agent
        Edit the diagram in the page: 3: Person
